            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eba abena Israeli utile, ‘Umwina Israeli onse nangufye umwinafyalo onse uwikala mu Israeli uwatuula umwana wakwe ku mulungu Moleki, afwile ukwipaiwa. Ibumba lya bantu lili nokumutobaula amabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkafutatila uyu muntu, kabili nkamutamfya na pebumba lya bantu bakwe. Pakutuula umwana wakwe ku mulungu Moleki, asebanya icifulo candi ne shina lyandi ilyamushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti ibumba lya bantu lyasuula umulandu uo uyu muntu acita pakutuula umwana wakwe kuli Moleki no kufilwa ukuti bamwipaye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ine nkamufutatila pamo no lupwa lwakwe, elyo nkamutamfya pebumba lya bantu bakwe bonse, pamo pene na bonse abakonkelela bucilende bwakupepa kuli Moleki.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
